        <main class="max-w-[900px] mx-auto px-5 md:px-8 py-12 space-y-10 text-[14px] leading-7 text-slate-600">
            <section><h2 class="text-[20px] font-extrabold text-slate-900">1. Educational content only — Not financial advice</h2><p class="mt-3">ScoreUp provides educational information about credit building. We are not a bank, lender, credit bureau, or financial advisor. Nothing on this site is financial, legal, or tax advice. For debt crisis, contact <a href="https://www.nfcc.org/" target="_blank" class="underline font-bold">NFCC.org</a> 1-800-388-2227 (free nonprofit). Always verify terms on official product sites (self.inc, chime.com, etc.).</p><div class="mt-4 p-4 rounded-xl bg-amber-50 border border-amber-200 text-amber-900"><b>Warning:</b> Credit products have risks. Pay on time, keep utilization under 30%, never borrow more than you can repay in 12 months. Payday loans avg 391% APR per CFPB — we never recommend them.</div></section>
            <section><h2 class="text-[20px] font-extrabold text-slate-900">2. Sources are real, authors are editorial team</h2><p class="mt-3">Data sourced from <a href="https://www.consumerfinance.gov/" target="_blank" class="underline">CFPB</a>, Experian, Equifax, TransUnion. Content written by ScoreUp Editorial Team, updated Oct 19, 2026. We do not use fake expert personas. See <a href="/Pages/About#editorial" class="underline font-bold">editorial policy</a> for how we rank.</p></section>
            <section><h2 class="text-[20px] font-extrabold text-slate-900">3. Affiliate disclosure</h2><p class="mt-3">We may earn commission if you apply via links to Self, Chime, Kikoff, Upstart, Oportun, Discover. Links have rel="sponsored". This does not affect rankings. See <a href="/Pages/About#how-we-make-money" class="underline font-bold">how we make money</a> and <a href="/Pages/About#disclosure" class="underline font-bold">ad disclosure</a>.</p></section>
            <section><h2 class="text-[20px] font-extrabold text-slate-900">4. No warranty</h2><p class="mt-3">Calculators use FICO 10T model estimates from Experian trends — not guarantees. Scores may vary. We are not liable for decisions you make based on our content. Use at your own risk.</p></section>
            <section><h2 class="text-[20px] font-extrabold text-slate-900">5. Contact</h2><p class="mt-3">Questions? <a href="/Pages/Contact" class="underline font-bold">Contact us</a> or email wandilecele28@gmail.com.</p></section>
